WEBVTT

00:10.967 --> 00:16.247
<i>Women are their families' property, 
subject to gift and exchange.</i>

00:17.027 --> 00:19.777
<i>When it comes to marriage, 
we must have no will of our own.</i>

00:20.517 --> 00:22.177
<i>And yet...</i>

00:23.037 --> 00:29.597
<i>Of my own free will, I loved someone 
I was forbidden to love.</i>

00:31.397 --> 00:35.647
<i>I was as happy as could be.</i>

02:03.287 --> 02:06.987
<b>Firefly Wedding</b>

02:06.987 --> 02:13.247
<b>An Unwanted Repayment</b>

02:21.197 --> 02:22.867
H-Hey.

02:22.867 --> 02:24.707
Stop staring and get back to work.

02:24.707 --> 02:28.247
Can you blame me? 
She almost never leaves the house.

02:28.827 --> 02:30.667
When am I gonna get another chance?

02:34.307 --> 02:36.007
I appreciate your work.

02:36.297 --> 02:37.997
Th-Thanks.

02:39.347 --> 02:41.767
She's too pretty for words.

02:46.767 --> 02:49.037
Sister!

02:50.407 --> 02:52.647
What on earth are you doing outside?

02:52.887 --> 02:55.367
You <i>know</i> you have a weak heart.

02:55.587 --> 02:58.697
You don't want to collapse 
in your suitor meeting tomorrow.

02:58.937 --> 03:00.047
What meeting?

03:00.047 --> 03:02.367
Your meeting with Lord Hatano, of course.

03:02.367 --> 03:06.447
Oh, are you trying to spare my feelings?

03:06.447 --> 03:07.827
That's all right.

03:08.147 --> 03:10.917
I know he chose you over me.

03:11.177 --> 03:12.457
Poor Miwako.

03:12.457 --> 03:13.627
Cheer up.

03:14.237 --> 03:17.297
Father rejected his suit.

03:17.297 --> 03:20.497
What? But he comes from 
such a well-known family.

03:20.497 --> 03:22.807
What could Father 
possibly have objected to?

03:23.217 --> 03:28.467
I don't know, but I aim to marry 
in accordance with Father's wishes.

03:28.467 --> 03:31.027
That's so depressing.

03:31.027 --> 03:36.477
I hear some commoners get to marry 
whoever they love, unlike us.

03:36.857 --> 03:38.487
That makes me envious.

03:38.487 --> 03:42.907
I felt so sure I could've made 
a love match with Lord Hatano.

03:43.597 --> 03:46.537
If you want to say something, 
come out and say it.

03:48.067 --> 03:49.537
Those flowers...

03:50.077 --> 03:54.797
I hear you're growing them
 for Father's birthday?

03:54.797 --> 03:57.257
You always play up to him like that,

03:57.257 --> 04:02.937
and you rob me of everything,
from Father's affections to my soulmate.

04:02.937 --> 04:04.117
Poor Miwako.

04:04.117 --> 04:06.677
I "rob" you? What a thing to say.

04:08.577 --> 04:11.467
You simply weren't chosen.

04:14.457 --> 04:19.407
The gentlemen who ask for your hand
 don't know, do they?

04:19.407 --> 04:23.277
About how that heart of yours
 won't hold out much longer.

04:25.697 --> 04:30.577
One of the maids said that while 
she was cleaning your room, she saw...

04:30.577 --> 04:33.087
your will.

04:33.777 --> 04:38.637
You'd better stay put in your room 
if you want to live as long as possible.

04:39.747 --> 04:42.047
Let me make one thing clear.

04:42.047 --> 04:44.927
The Hatono family began this suit.

04:45.657 --> 04:49.187
While you've neglected your training
 and studies to enjoy yourself,

04:49.577 --> 04:55.177
I've cultivated myself 
to appear graceful and beautiful.

04:55.177 --> 04:57.697
My diligence has been rewarded.

04:58.417 --> 05:04.157
Being a burden on our family, I have 
always striven to find value in myself.

05:05.197 --> 05:06.757
You'd like to think so.

05:07.597 --> 05:11.417
In any case, you should save 
your concern for yourself.

05:11.837 --> 05:13.417
Well, I mean...

05:13.777 --> 05:16.697
You have nothing to recommend you
 but your looks.

05:17.747 --> 05:19.007
I <i>beg</i> your pardon?

05:19.267 --> 05:24.557
And with your personality...
I don't think you'll ever find a husband.

05:24.967 --> 05:27.127
Well, you might as well keep trying.

05:27.517 --> 05:29.267
You're awful!

05:29.577 --> 05:31.767
Mother will hear about this!

05:36.017 --> 05:38.857
<i>Perhaps I did get a little too worked up.</i>

05:39.697 --> 05:41.317
<i>I'll go inside.</i>

05:43.417 --> 05:45.277
<i>Soon after I was born,</i>

05:45.527 --> 05:48.657
<i>my mother passed away, 
and my father remarried.</i>

05:53.157 --> 06:00.257
<i>My stepmother had Miwako with my father, 
and we're now a family of four.</i>

06:00.977 --> 06:03.627
<i>I have a naturally weak constitution,</i>

06:03.627 --> 06:08.257
<i>and the doctors say 
I likely don't have long to live.</i>

06:08.527 --> 06:14.277
<i>I guess Miwako can't bear that I receive
 so many marriage offers regardless.</i>

06:14.647 --> 06:15.767
<i>And...</i>

06:15.767 --> 06:20.377
<i>My stepmother detests me 
even more than she does.</i>

06:21.337 --> 06:24.837
<i>She thinks I'm an impediment
to Miwako's marriage prospects.</i>

06:26.017 --> 06:29.127
<i>I have only one ally in this house.</i>

06:30.557 --> 06:31.907
Father.

06:31.907 --> 06:32.787
Yes?

06:35.587 --> 06:37.917
You had another fight with Miwako?

06:37.917 --> 06:41.417
I can't help it. She always provokes me.

06:42.567 --> 06:45.587
You've grown up to be a real firecracker.

06:46.927 --> 06:48.377
Satoko.

06:48.927 --> 06:54.687
There's another marriage offer for you.
From the son of a friend of mine.

06:55.117 --> 06:56.547
Would you meet with him?

06:58.247 --> 07:00.937
Have you told him about my health?

07:02.387 --> 07:03.177
No.

07:03.567 --> 07:06.777
Of course not. He wouldn't want
 to meet me if he knew.

07:07.317 --> 07:11.117
But I don't want to fool
 my future husband.

07:14.357 --> 07:15.867
Satoko.

07:16.497 --> 07:24.377
You need protection and money to 
hire good doctors and lead a happy life.

07:24.647 --> 07:28.387
You may think I'm always going on
 about these marriage talks,

07:28.697 --> 07:33.887
but I can't help wanting the best for you.

07:34.617 --> 07:40.647
Fortunately, nature has blessed you with 
the Kirigaya name and your good looks.

07:41.267 --> 07:45.717
I know you'll find a man 
to love and cherish you.

07:46.497 --> 07:50.407
Oh, stop talking about my looks.
 You're embarrassing me.

07:50.407 --> 07:55.707
Satoko, I don't believe the doctors 
on how much time you have left.

07:56.037 --> 08:00.297
You will live. I'm sure of it.

08:00.947 --> 08:02.547
<i>Father.</i>

08:03.167 --> 08:07.797
<i>Since I was a little girl, you've worried 
about my health more than anyone.</i>

08:08.677 --> 08:10.547
<i>Father's wish...</i>

08:10.547 --> 08:14.337
<i>is for me to marry and be happy.</i>

08:14.337 --> 08:16.307
<i>Nothing more.</i>

08:17.097 --> 08:18.057
<i>But...</i>

08:18.697 --> 08:24.667
<i>I doubt any man would take a bride 
who needs so much medical care.</i>

08:26.317 --> 08:28.607
I'd like a little time to consider.

08:29.827 --> 08:31.607
By the way, Father...

08:32.437 --> 08:34.887
May I make a brief trip into town?

08:34.887 --> 08:35.867
Into town?

08:35.867 --> 08:37.537
Whatever for?

08:37.537 --> 08:39.727
Well, for this and that.

08:39.727 --> 08:41.607
But think of your health—

08:41.607 --> 08:45.127
Please. I'll take Kotaro with me.

08:47.237 --> 08:49.237
What am I going to do with you?

08:52.127 --> 08:55.077
I can't believe Father gave me
 his permission.

08:55.077 --> 08:56.717
Can you, Kotaro?

08:57.077 --> 08:58.217
It is surprising.

08:58.727 --> 09:00.637
Oh, this is the place.

09:01.637 --> 09:03.837
May I spend a little time here?

09:04.167 --> 09:08.947
I'll take care of an errand His Lordship 
asked me to run in the meantime.

09:08.947 --> 09:10.177
All right.

09:10.177 --> 09:11.697
Stay out of the sunlight.

09:12.397 --> 09:14.947
And please try not to exert yourself.

09:14.947 --> 09:17.697
We'll return at once 
if you don't feel well.

09:17.977 --> 09:20.747
Whatever you do, don't leave this shop.

09:22.457 --> 09:25.687
<i>Kotaro is such a worrywart.</i>

09:28.067 --> 09:30.057
<i>Which one would work best?</i>

09:31.647 --> 09:35.987
<i>The flowers are colorful, 
so I'd like a more reserved vase.</i>

09:35.987 --> 09:38.057
<i>Then, I'll arrange them prettily and...</i>

09:41.167 --> 09:44.557
<i>It really would be a shame to pluck them.</i>

09:45.507 --> 09:48.317
<i>I'll take Father to see them
 in the garden.</i>

09:48.737 --> 09:52.397
<i>It won't seem like much of a present,
 but a life is a life.</i>

09:53.377 --> 09:56.867
I can't help wanting the best for you.

09:57.567 --> 09:59.437
<i>Marriage...</i>

09:59.987 --> 10:04.457
<i>If only there were someone 
who would accept my infirmity,</i>

10:04.757 --> 10:06.477
<i>whom Father would approve of,</i>

10:06.477 --> 10:08.957
<i>and with whom I could love and be loved.</i>

10:11.467 --> 10:13.417
<i>I'm getting greedy again.</i>

10:13.737 --> 10:16.307
<i>Who knows if such a person even exists?</i>

10:21.297 --> 10:23.387
<i>June 27th.</i>

10:23.607 --> 10:25.577
Lady Satoko, it's time we—

10:26.857 --> 10:28.897
<i>On this day,</i>

10:29.697 --> 10:32.607
<i>I found myself abducted by strange men.</i>

10:37.957 --> 10:41.307
<b>Firefly
Wedding</b>

10:38.997 --> 10:42.597
Oh? So this is the girl?

10:42.597 --> 10:45.037
She's a real looker.

10:45.037 --> 10:47.057
<i>Who are these people?</i>

10:47.057 --> 10:50.127
<i>They blindfolded me 
on the way here. Where am I?</i>

10:50.127 --> 10:51.477
Where's Goto?

10:52.757 --> 10:55.537
He just got back. See?

11:16.937 --> 11:18.227
Did you get him?

11:19.747 --> 11:20.527
Yeah.

11:22.417 --> 11:26.537
That bastard gave us a hell of a time,
but he only took you one day.

11:26.997 --> 11:31.547
I guess they weren't kidding 
when they called you a legend.

11:32.077 --> 11:35.377
Anyway, since you're here, 
I've got another job for you.

11:35.937 --> 11:38.387
Could you kill this woman for me?

11:40.637 --> 11:44.557
Only my client said
 not to kill her right away,

11:44.557 --> 11:46.517
so keep an eye on her for a bit.

11:46.517 --> 11:50.347
Then, kill her at nine.

11:50.807 --> 11:52.777
Crying shame, though.

11:52.777 --> 11:56.867
Still, my client's got deep pockets.

11:56.867 --> 11:58.527
I'll make it worth your while.

12:00.287 --> 12:01.367
All right.

12:03.337 --> 12:06.787
None of you even think about raping her.

12:07.197 --> 12:10.697
This guy'll carve you up for me
 if you try anything.

12:10.697 --> 12:12.287
Fine.

12:14.307 --> 12:19.297
Well, he was giving me lip, 
so I really let him have it!

12:31.177 --> 12:32.057
Want some?

12:35.797 --> 12:38.567
What'd you do for somebody 
to want you dead?

12:58.927 --> 13:01.367
You sure are pretty.

13:01.367 --> 13:03.847
Pale as a ghost, though.

13:03.847 --> 13:05.887
<i>Who is this man?</i>

13:07.277 --> 13:12.017
<i>I know he's staring at me, 
but I can't tell where he's looking.</i>

13:12.727 --> 13:14.147
<i>He scares me.</i>

13:14.467 --> 13:16.077
So what's the story?

13:16.077 --> 13:19.937
I-I haven't done anything! 
There's been some mistake!

13:19.937 --> 13:21.197
Please let me out of here!

13:21.477 --> 13:25.447
No can do. My job is to kill you.

13:26.317 --> 13:28.947
<i>What should I do? 
I have to do something.</i>

13:29.607 --> 13:32.707
<i>But how? It can't be long until nine.</i>

13:33.017 --> 13:35.077
Is there no way out for me?!

13:37.817 --> 13:42.837
I could take your side, if you can pay me
 more than these guys will.

13:46.067 --> 13:50.107
<i>What can I do against all of them,
 even with his help?</i>

13:50.687 --> 13:52.347
<i>Still, though...</i>

13:52.767 --> 13:54.157
Let me hire you!

13:54.157 --> 13:57.207
I don't have money with me, 
but I promise to pay you when I get home—

13:57.207 --> 13:57.977
I don't trust you.

13:58.427 --> 13:59.797
Then, take my kimono!

13:59.797 --> 14:00.857
No, thanks.

14:01.757 --> 14:04.237
I think I'll make more from 
what these guys pay me.

14:04.667 --> 14:06.047
No...

14:06.047 --> 14:07.627
Hey, kid!

14:07.627 --> 14:08.827
Move it.

14:09.677 --> 14:11.957
All right. Don't make a fuss.

14:17.477 --> 14:18.657
No!

14:19.597 --> 14:20.797
Stop!

14:20.387 --> 14:22.767
Hey, are you sure about this?

14:22.767 --> 14:25.507
No one'll care if no one finds out. 
Either way, she's gonna—

14:26.287 --> 14:28.317
That hurt. You bitch!

14:28.927 --> 14:31.537
Hold her down. Let's get this over with.

14:32.357 --> 14:33.887
<i>This couldn't be any worse.</i>

14:34.407 --> 14:38.067
<i>If I lose my chastity, 
there go my dreams of marriage.</i>

14:39.177 --> 14:40.587
<i>Father.</i>

14:41.717 --> 14:44.317
<i>Father, I want to repay you.</i>

14:44.317 --> 14:48.657
<i>I want to make your dreams 
for my marriage come true.</i>

14:48.657 --> 14:53.157
<i>That's been my goal in life.</i>

14:53.697 --> 14:56.497
<i>If I die here, without even 
making my parent happy,</i>

14:58.087 --> 15:01.507
<i>I'll have been born for nothing!</i>

15:01.797 --> 15:02.757
Hey, guys.

15:03.837 --> 15:07.717
I'm supposed to cut up anybody 
who touches the woman.

15:07.717 --> 15:08.597
Wha?!

15:08.597 --> 15:09.597
Can I start with you?

15:09.597 --> 15:11.047
Shut your trap!

15:11.047 --> 15:13.717
I don't care who calls you 
a "legend," kid! You don't—

15:22.657 --> 15:25.607
W-Wait! I haven't done anything yet!

15:25.607 --> 15:30.117
I'll take a limb for 
every time you touch her.

15:34.307 --> 15:35.587
<i>Think.</i>

15:35.587 --> 15:37.457
<i>How can I get out of here alive?</i>

15:38.417 --> 15:39.697
<i>I want to live.</i>

15:39.697 --> 15:41.337
<i>I don't want to give up!</i>

15:41.747 --> 15:43.927
<i>How can I win over this man?</i>

15:43.927 --> 15:47.337
<i>I need to convince him 
that I'm worth keeping alive.</i>

15:47.337 --> 15:49.827
<i>I need something... </i>anything<i> of value.</i>

15:49.827 --> 15:52.477
<i>What do I have of value?</i>

15:53.187 --> 15:56.227
Nature has blessed you 
with the Kirigaya name.

15:58.137 --> 15:59.237
I...

16:01.527 --> 16:03.527
I'm valuable myself.

16:05.207 --> 16:08.607
If you join me, you can have it all!

16:08.897 --> 16:11.617
We should get married!

16:14.087 --> 16:15.327
Married?

16:15.877 --> 16:17.787
I've fallen head over heels for you.

16:20.397 --> 16:21.877
You say some funny things.

16:22.237 --> 16:25.837
My father is a count! 
I'm a proper noblewoman!

16:25.837 --> 16:29.647
Marry me, and you'll never want 
for anything as long as you live!

16:29.647 --> 16:31.507
What made you fall for me?

16:31.507 --> 16:35.637
What? Well, um, how punctual you are...

16:36.577 --> 16:40.057
A-And the way you offered to
 share your rice balls with me.

16:43.907 --> 16:44.897
Hey, Goto!

16:44.897 --> 16:46.297
The hell are you doing?

16:46.297 --> 16:49.697
They tried to rape the woman,
 so I cut them up.

16:50.037 --> 16:52.857
Are you nuts? We were told 
to keep our hands off.

16:52.857 --> 16:55.187
So? We're gonna kill her anyway!

16:55.187 --> 16:57.957
We can just rape her 
and keep quiet about it!

16:58.277 --> 17:01.127
No one's ever found out before now!

17:05.277 --> 17:06.877
Sheesh.

17:08.777 --> 17:10.437
You're all just as bad.

17:11.687 --> 17:13.887
Take your jobs seriously, why don't you?

17:15.717 --> 17:17.707
What are you doing?

17:18.137 --> 17:19.667
Damn it, Goto!

17:30.167 --> 17:32.307
Oh, hey. You're alive.

17:33.767 --> 17:34.907
Okay, then.

17:35.247 --> 17:37.837
I'd like to hear more about your offer.

17:37.837 --> 17:40.247
<i>He took the bait of marriage?</i>

17:40.537 --> 17:41.907
Please help me!

17:41.907 --> 17:44.077
I'll reward you by marrying you!

17:44.077 --> 17:47.267
So it'd be a loveless marriage?

17:47.267 --> 17:48.817
<i>You have to ask?</i>

17:48.817 --> 17:51.337
<i>I know you only care about the money.</i>

17:51.337 --> 17:54.337
Of course, if I can be of use 
to you in some other way—

17:54.337 --> 17:55.347
There they are!

17:55.347 --> 17:56.097
This way!

17:56.097 --> 17:57.257
You bitch!

17:57.257 --> 17:58.677
I'll rape you good!

17:58.677 --> 18:00.467
<i>They've already caught up to us?</i>

18:00.467 --> 18:01.557
In that case...

18:02.297 --> 18:04.197
Let's make a vow.

18:04.897 --> 18:06.317
A vow?

18:07.037 --> 18:08.277
Kiss me.

18:10.497 --> 18:12.267
You fell in love with me, right?

18:14.527 --> 18:17.507
And we're going to get married, right?

18:17.507 --> 18:22.197
But I, um, must preserve 
my chastity until marriage.

18:22.197 --> 18:23.577
Even a kiss would be, well...

18:23.577 --> 18:27.667
Does your chastity matter
 more than your life?

18:57.007 --> 18:58.417
About that kiss.

18:59.447 --> 19:02.037
You don't have to if you don't want to.

19:04.727 --> 19:06.537
And if I refuse?

19:06.957 --> 19:09.457
I'll just kill you when I'm supposed to.

19:14.307 --> 19:16.637
<i>It's strangely quiet.</i>

19:20.477 --> 19:22.927
<i>I can't hear anything 
but my own heartbeat.</i>

19:25.097 --> 19:30.417
<i>This fierce beat is urging me to flee.</i>

19:36.657 --> 19:39.197
You're so reluctant.

19:39.197 --> 19:41.907
I guess you were lying 
about falling for me.

19:41.907 --> 19:43.197
That's too bad.

19:43.417 --> 19:44.647
N-No, I—

19:44.647 --> 19:46.457
Are you scared of me?

19:47.007 --> 19:50.637
I bet you've never seen 
this much blood before.

19:50.637 --> 19:53.957
Must be nice, being rich.

19:54.487 --> 19:57.627
You never have to worry 
about your future, do you?

20:00.887 --> 20:04.217
<i>What would </i>you<i> know?</i>

20:26.957 --> 20:28.257
Pardon me.

20:28.257 --> 20:32.917
Getting another person's blood 
in my mouth would be poor hygiene.

20:35.567 --> 20:37.797
I have no future.

20:37.797 --> 20:41.087
I have a bad heart, 
and my days are numbered.

20:41.657 --> 20:42.927
So...

20:43.347 --> 20:46.017
I prepare for the worst 
every day of my life.

20:52.897 --> 20:54.357
Let's get married!

20:55.567 --> 20:59.897
I can't believe you kissed me 
when I'd just killed people.

20:59.897 --> 21:01.817
You're the greatest.

21:02.037 --> 21:06.107
All the other women ran away 
as soon as I told them about my job.

21:06.107 --> 21:08.707
I had to kill them to keep them quiet.

21:09.077 --> 21:11.817
But you've accepted me.

21:11.817 --> 21:14.337
You must be my soulmate.

21:15.267 --> 21:18.507
My love can be a little intense,

21:21.617 --> 21:23.667
but I'll make you happy.

22:50.777 --> 22:55.257
Produced by the Firefly Wedding Anime Production Committee
